%   brass chord (Tpt 1 B4, Hn 1 F sharp 4, Hn 2 D sharp 4), while the upper octave has Fl 1 with Vln I (Rimsky-Korsakov PDF 76: a wind in unison with a string group increases its resonance and amplifies its tone;
