% c256: "non arpegg." on the first off-beat chord of each accompaniment entry (81, 185, 225): Rimsky-Korsakov PDF 46, harp chords "must always be broken (arpeggiato); should the composer wish otherwise he should notify it (non arpeggiato)". 153 and 341 already say so; 81 said nothing, and 185 and 225 follow 16 bars rest at a new letter. Chords meant broken keep their arpeggio sign (149, 151, 237, 361).
