% c307: 70 violas A4-G sharp 4 (were E5-D5): Vln II's stretto entry E5-B4-B4-E5 began on the violas' E5 and ran under them (crossing on beat 2, a second E5/D5 on beat 3), so the entry was hidden in its own colour; the violas now lie under it and the bar sounds A minor -> E over the A pedal (adler1 PDF 144: theme and countertheme separated in register; PDF 135: background out of the melody's register when the colour is the same). Completes c097, which gave Vln II this entry while the violas kept their old coupling a sixth under Vln I.
